  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for sssd",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for sssd fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-68743: insufficient validation in the PAM responder can lead to an out-of-bounds read and a process crash\n  when a crafted protocol v1 request is processed (bsc#1273925).\n- CVE-2026-12610: cancelled or completed PAM request while the asynchronous child process is still running can lead to\n  a use-after-free (bsc#1269807).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
